        The Archontic matrix does not need to actively guard you; it relies on the automated, myelinated pathways of your own nervous system to keep you imprisoned. To escape, you must master the rhythm of evolution: violently dissolving the mechanical loops of the False Personality (Solve) and permanently forging a new sovereign reality (Coagula).
      </p>
